{"page":492,"width":1722,"height":2385,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"8 10 13 14 18 19 21 24 37 40 45 71","words":[{"text":"8","x":454,"y":525,"width":13,"height":20},{"text":"10","x":504,"y":525,"width":26,"height":20},{"text":"13","x":560,"y":526,"width":26,"height":19},{"text":"14","x":616,"y":526,"width":27,"height":19},{"text":"18","x":672,"y":526,"width":27,"height":19},{"text":"19","x":728,"y":526,"width":26,"height":19},{"text":"21","x":783,"y":525,"width":27,"height":20},{"text":"24","x":839,"y":525,"width":27,"height":19},{"text":"37","x":894,"y":523,"width":27,"height":21},{"text":"40","x":949,"y":523,"width":28,"height":20},{"text":"45","x":1004,"y":523,"width":28,"height":19},{"text":"71","x":1059,"y":522,"width":28,"height":20}]},{"text":"1 3 4 6 7","words":[{"text":"1","x":172,"y":528,"width":12,"height":19},{"text":"3","x":229,"y":527,"width":13,"height":19},{"text":"4","x":285,"y":526,"width":14,"height":19},{"text":"6","x":342,"y":525,"width":13,"height":20},{"text":"7","x":397,"y":525,"width":14,"height":19}]},{"text":"이진 담색의 예를 들어보자. 두 사람이 서로 상대방이 생각하고 있는 숫x卜를 맞추는 게임을 생","words":[{"text":"이진","x":185,"y":640,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"담색의","x":254,"y":640,"width":83,"height":30},{"text":"예를","x":351,"y":640,"width":57,"height":30},{"text":"들어보자.","x":418,"y":640,"width":121,"height":30},{"text":"두","x":553,"y":641,"width":29,"height":30},{"text":"사람이","x":592,"y":640,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"서로","x":688,"y":640,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"상대방이","x":754,"y":638,"width":112,"height":32},{"text":"생각하고","x":880,"y":638,"width":112,"height":31},{"text":"있는","x":1004,"y":637,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"숫x卜를","x":1068,"y":637,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"맞추는","x":1164,"y":637,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"게임을","x":1259,"y":635,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"생","x":1354,"y":635,"width":25,"height":32}]},{"text":"각하자. 예를 들어 1에서 1%만까지의 숫자를 하나 생각하라. 상대방은 하나의 숫자를 추측하여","words":[{"text":"각하자.","x":152,"y":693,"width":94,"height":30},{"text":"예를","x":263,"y":692,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"들어","x":331,"y":692,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"1에서","x":401,"y":692,"width":64,"height":31},{"text":"1%만까지의","x":481,"y":692,"width":157,"height":31},{"text":"숫자를","x":652,"y":693,"width":86,"height":30},{"text":"하나","x":749,"y":692,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"생각하라.","x":819,"y":691,"width":119,"height":32},{"text":"상대방은","x":953,"y":690,"width":113,"height":31},{"text":"하나의","x":1077,"y":690,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"숫자를","x":1172,"y":691,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"추측하여","x":1268,"y":689,"width":110,"height":33}]},{"text":"밀하고 다른 상대방은 그 숫자가 맞는지 아니면 큰지, 작은지 만을 알려준다. 이러한 게임에서","words":[{"text":"밀하고","x":152,"y":744,"width":88,"height":31},{"text":"다른","x":254,"y":745,"width":58,"height":30},{"text":"상대방은","x":324,"y":744,"width":115,"height":31},{"text":"그","x":451,"y":748,"width":29,"height":21},{"text":"숫자가","x":492,"y":744,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"맞는지","x":592,"y":744,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"아니면","x":690,"y":744,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"큰지,","x":788,"y":745,"width":65,"height":31},{"text":"작은지","x":869,"y":743,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"만을","x":968,"y":743,"width":56,"height":30},{"text":"알려준다.","x":1036,"y":742,"width":119,"height":32},{"text":"이러한","x":1173,"y":744,"width":84,"height":30},{"text":"게임에서","x":1269,"y":743,"width":109,"height":31}]},{"text":"몇 번 만에 상대방이 생각하는 숫자를 맞출 수 있을까? 정답은 20번이다. 만약 숫자의 범위가 더","words":[{"text":"몇","x":153,"y":797,"width":25,"height":30},{"text":"번","x":193,"y":796,"width":26,"height":30},{"text":"만에","x":232,"y":797,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"상대방이","x":300,"y":796,"width":112,"height":31},{"text":"생각하는","x":426,"y":796,"width":114,"height":31},{"text":"숫자를","x":550,"y":797,"width":87,"height":30},{"text":"맞출","x":646,"y":797,"width":58,"height":30},{"text":"수","x":713,"y":797,"width":29,"height":30},{"text":"있을까?","x":754,"y":797,"width":101,"height":30},{"text":"정답은","x":867,"y":796,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"20번이다.","x":961,"y":795,"width":124,"height":31},{"text":"만약","x":1099,"y":795,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"숫자의","x":1164,"y":797,"width":82,"height":30},{"text":"범위가","x":1260,"y":796,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"더","x":1354,"y":796,"width":23,"height":31}]},{"text":"작다면 훨씬 적은 횟수만으로 맞출 수 있다. 이러한 방법이 이진 탐색이다.","words":[{"text":"작다면","x":152,"y":848,"width":86,"height":30},{"text":"훨씬","x":251,"y":848,"width":56,"height":30},{"text":"적은","x":320,"y":848,"width":56,"height":30},{"text":"횟수만으로","x":387,"y":848,"width":142,"height":30},{"text":"맞출","x":539,"y":849,"width":58,"height":30},{"text":"수","x":606,"y":848,"width":30,"height":31},{"text":"있다.","x":647,"y":848,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"이러한","x":723,"y":849,"width":86,"height":30},{"text":"방법이","x":819,"y":849,"width":82,"height":30},{"text":"이진","x":915,"y":848,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"탐색이다.","x":981,"y":847,"width":120,"height":31}]},{"text":"이진 탐색은 실제로 우리가 일상생활에서 많이 이용하고 있는 방법이다. 영어 사전에서 단어","words":[{"text":"이진","x":185,"y":900,"width":57,"height":30},{"text":"탐색은","x":256,"y":900,"width":88,"height":29},{"text":"실제로","x":356,"y":900,"width":85,"height":29},{"text":"우리가","x":453,"y":899,"width":87,"height":31},{"text":"일상생활에서","x":553,"y":900,"width":167,"height":31},{"text":"많이","x":736,"y":901,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"이용하고","x":807,"y":901,"width":113,"height":31},{"text":"있는","x":933,"y":900,"width":56,"height":30},{"text":"방법이다.","x":1000,"y":899,"width":119,"height":31},{"text":"영어","x":1137,"y":901,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"사전에서","x":1203,"y":901,"width":108,"height":31},{"text":"단어","x":1326,"y":901,"width":53,"height":31}]},{"text":"를 찾을 때 항상 사우하고 있는 방법이 이진 탐색이다. 즉 [그림 13-5]처럼 영어 사전을 펼쳐서 우","words":[{"text":"를","x":150,"y":952,"width":30,"height":29},{"text":"찾을","x":191,"y":951,"width":59,"height":30},{"text":"때","x":262,"y":951,"width":25,"height":30},{"text":"항상","x":300,"y":951,"width":59,"height":30},{"text":"사우하고","x":369,"y":950,"width":11